{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>《Rabbit Moon》是一款結合月經記錄、心情筆記與日月曆資訊的隨身工具，適合希望以簡單方式追蹤週期、整理感受，又重視個人資料留存在本機的使用者。它現時由原價 US $0.99 轉為<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，預測內容僅供參考，並非醫療建議。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-197.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>日月曆與月經記錄</h2>\n<p>日頁同時顯示公曆、農曆、生肖年份、二十四節氣與月相；月經開始及結束均可一按記錄，預測與提醒保持安靜。你可隨時寫下幾行心情，加入 [[關鍵字 以便日後搜尋，或在日曆篩選相關日子。程式毋須註冊或建立帳戶，支援鎖定，沒有追蹤及第三方分析 SDK，記錄只留在自己的手機。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-167-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-168-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-169-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-170-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Rabbit Moon: Cycle &amp; Diary</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/rabbit-moon-cycle-diary/id6796885613?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T00:32:38.282757+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":327,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T00:03:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T15:36:59.483173+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T00:26:05.210782+00:00","content_hash":"ccc1a7f77d02a770c80e71b1c9e021e6f0f278241ef6b9aaae3851c5131c838a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}